  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {資格|しかく}{取得|しゅとく} (obtaining a qualification)\n- {免許|めんきょ}を{取得|しゅとく}する (acquire a license)\n- {特許|とっきょ}を{取得|しゅとく}する (obtain a patent)\n- {有給|ゆうきゅう}{取得|しゅとく} (taking paid leave)\n- データを{取得|しゅとく}する (acquire/retrieve data)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{取|と}る is the everyday word for getting or taking something. {取得|しゅとく} is the formal, written equivalent used for official acquisitions — licenses, qualifications, rights, and properties. In IT contexts, {取得|しゅとく} is also used for retrieving or fetching data.",
